// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:12
//#		2009-06-02 JL	Finished updating from page images.
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:13
//#		2010-12-31 JL	Fixed page number comments.
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:14
//#
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:15
//# This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:16
//# images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:17
//# by Fjeld Kerman, and arranged for by Douglas Kerman of the Museum.  Many
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:18
//# thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
// CONIC_SUBROUTINES.agc:19
//# consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
